"US-0412: Pipeline cards with more LCARS feeling and motion. The stage cards from US-0411 in src/renderer/Pipeline.jsx (stage-card rules in src/renderer/theme.css) should look and move more like LCARS: bolder header strips, elbows or segment blocks; purposeful animations such as a power-up when the pipeline opens, a sweep when a stage changes state, a flash when a stage completes. Reduced gives static effects and Off no motion, as the animations setting does everywhere; nothing flashes more than 3 times per second; only transform, opacity, filter and box-shadow animate. A mockup is approved before any code."
